sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Caller (engine)
    participant D as Diagrams
    participant C as DiagramCache
    participant P as DiagramProvider

    Caller->>D: render(request)
    D->>D: checksum(request)
    D->>C: get(checksum)
    alt cached
        C-->>D: path of the SVG
    else not cached
        D->>P: render(request)
        P-->>D: SVG text, or DiagramError
        D->>C: put(checksum, svg)
        C-->>D: path of the SVG
    end
    D-->>Caller: path of the SVG
